{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/0cc3473e1bb05285be40d5ba8997bc2a.avif?t=1774038749\" alt=\"Unmasked Truths is made by humans, not AI. \" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras_big/0cc3473e1bb05285be40d5ba8997bc2a.webp?t=1774038749 width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong>Unmasked Truths: Shattered Dreams</strong> is a murder mystery releasing episodically in 3 massive, fully voiced (<strong>English</strong> and <strong>Japanese</strong>) arcs. The first arc releases in late 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The immersive, character-focused storytelling and game mechanics aim to provide a fresh, modern take on nostalgic late \u201890s, \u201800s, and 2010\u2019s-era murder mystery (and especially \u201ckilling game\u201d) fan favorite series and games where players take on a detective-like role similar to those found in Danganronpa, Ai: The Somnium Files, Persona 5, and Ace Attorney. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character designs inspired by the likes of Genshin Impact and Nier: Automata blend seamlessly with a 3D world in which Baroque-inspired architecture is brought into the future with a subtle sci-fi twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unmasked Truths is perfect for fans of visual novels and detective games brimming with rich, dramatic narratives that grip players and stick with them long after the game\u2019s mysteries are solved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are <i>you</i> ready for a story you\u2019ll never forget?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unmasked Truths: Shattered Dreams is proudly created by humans, not AI.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/9ac4162d0bd141ab6483bbf38f9a2860.avif?t=1774038749\" width=500 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s the year 20XX and 10 world-renowned experts have agreed to take a rocket ride into space where they will take part in a first-of-its-kind intensive summer program run by the world\u2019s top governing authority.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their goal? Prove that they are the best of the best and worthy of the exclusive title:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World\u2606Class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a relaxing stay managed by AI twins at a lavish baroque space resort-turned-college-campus takes a deadly turn when it\u2019s revealed that only 5 individuals will be graduating with their title\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...and their lives.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players rotate between characters throughout the story, including a no-nonsense prosecutor, happy-go-lucky daredevil, strong-of-heart street fighter, K-Pop idol, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the 3D environment to collect evidence, participate in themed trials and minigames, and cast your vote to discover the truth of who's living a lie in this fully voiced murder mystery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/406f5ff9ba84a53ad31dfe60eedb05b3.webp?t=1774038749\" width=500 height=35 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/aac6092a7a1be025e162a0c87f9ee7f7.poster.avif?t=1774038749\" aria-label=\"Characters are fully voiced in English\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/aac6092a7a1be025e162a0c87f9ee7f7.webm?t=1774038749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/aac6092a7a1be025e162a0c87f9ee7f7.mp4?t=1774038749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Character dialogue is fully voiced in </u></strong><u>English <strong>and</strong> Japanese<strong>, featuring the talents of:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sophia Alexandra, World\u2606Class Teacher\u00a0-\u00a0<strong>Cherami Leigh</strong>\u00a0(English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maria Dandois, World\u2606Class Street Fighter -\u00a0<strong>Heather Gonzalez</strong>\u00a0(English),\u00a0<strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kristine Brown,\u00a0World\u2606Class Voyager -\u00a0<strong>Suzie McGrath</strong>\u00a0(English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ashe Buckley,\u00a0World\u2606Class Hunter -\u00a0<strong>Casey Mongillo</strong>\u00a0(English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lee Dae Hyun,\u00a0World\u2606Class Idol \u2014\u00a0<strong>Jason Vu</strong>, (English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucienne Gant,\u00a0World\u2606Class Barista - <strong>Ryan Bartley</strong>\u00a0(English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sergei Ivankov,\u00a0World\u2606Class Manager -\u00a0<strong>Kyle McCarley</strong>\u00a0(English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jack Pakenham,\u00a0World\u2606Class Daredevil - <strong>Leigh Joel Scott</strong>\u00a0(English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Izumi Sada, World\u2606Class Psychologist - <strong>Jenny Yokobori</strong>\u00a0(English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leandre Tha\u00efs, &quot;Some Guy&quot; - <strong>Nazeeh Tarsha</strong>\u00a0(English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renard Tha\u00efs,\u00a0World\u2606Class Prosecutor - <strong>Alejandro Saab</strong>\u00a0(English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alice - <strong>Xanthe Hyunh</strong>\u00a0(English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thomas -\u00a0<strong>Nathan Vitale</strong>\u00a0(English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Papa &quot;Joe&quot; Razzi -\u00a0<strong>Joe Zieja</strong>\u00a0(English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/4fb004aa4c7a2a5f7be72bef59b40f4d.poster.avif?t=1774038749\" aria-label=\"Choices change relationships and the game&#039;s ending\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/4fb004aa4c7a2a5f7be72bef59b40f4d.webm?t=1774038749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/4fb004aa4c7a2a5f7be72bef59b40f4d.mp4?t=1774038749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Decisions Matter</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player choices impact character relationships, unlock routes, unveil bonus scenes, and ultimately determine who survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/16e7bb24e34d652a49fd0cbdb3105c60.avif?t=1774038749\" alt=\"Play as different characters to learn the full story.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras_big/16e7bb24e34d652a49fd0cbdb3105c60.webp?t=1774038749 width=1560 height=1101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Everyone is a Suspect</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone has been killed, and everyone is a potential suspect. Investigate the  scene for clues and gather evidence before engaging in a high-stakes debate to unveil the truth and unmask the murderer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/20d8ed9283370d59c9b1e18513cd07a5.avif?t=1774038749\" alt=\"Mirror your partner&#039;s moves in rhythm minigames!\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras_big/20d8ed9283370d59c9b1e18513cd07a5.webp?t=1774038749 width=1560 height=879 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/6d3c20b3bc629f7d012d020a6950680d.avif?t=1774038749\" alt=\"Fish for answers in this classic fishing minigame with a twist!\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras_big/6d3c20b3bc629f7d012d020a6950680d.webp?t=1774038749 width=1560 height=879 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Minigames</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress the story by clearing minigames inspired by the characters' unique skills! Fish for answers, engage in heated battles to see whose evidence is stronger, mirror your partner's moves to support their arguments, remove mental blocks to uncover clues, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/2f642a3edbc8f874f778a8b7ab582250.poster.avif?t=1774038749\" aria-label=\"Explore a vast 3D environment\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/2f642a3edbc8f874f778a8b7ab582250.webm?t=1774038749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/2f642a3edbc8f874f778a8b7ab582250.mp4?t=1774038749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Free Roaming / Free Time Exploration</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam the vast college campus to discover more about the world, collect hidden items, witness spectacular views, and learn more about characters. The information may come in handy when unraveling the secrets of this social deduction game...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3512720?t=1774038749","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/850d6300e696f77e4b0054c11a11f907a4e5507b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774038749","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/7084b5a43f90d0e4c61a2151be9971e4304c9ee4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774038749","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/7084b5a43f90d0e4c61a2151be9971e4304c9ee4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774038749","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This murder mystery visual novel explores or implies aspects of psychology and mental health.\r\n\r\nThe game also includes blood and violence.\r\n\r\nPlease play with care."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/0cc3473e1bb05285be40d5ba8997bc2a.avif?t=1774038749\" alt=\"Unmasked Truths is made by humans, not AI. \" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras_big/0cc3473e1bb05285be40d5ba8997bc2a.webp?t=1774038749 width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong>Unmasked Truths: Shattered Dreams</strong> is a murder mystery releasing episodically in 3 massive, fully voiced (<strong>English</strong> and <strong>Japanese</strong>) arcs. The first arc releases in late 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The immersive, character-focused storytelling and game mechanics aim to provide a fresh, modern take on nostalgic late \u201890s, \u201800s, and 2010\u2019s-era murder mystery (and especially \u201ckilling game\u201d) fan favorite series and games where players take on a detective-like role similar to those found in Danganronpa, Ai: The Somnium Files, Persona 5, and Ace Attorney. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character designs inspired by the likes of Genshin Impact and Nier: Automata blend seamlessly with a 3D world in which Baroque-inspired architecture is brought into the future with a subtle sci-fi twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unmasked Truths is perfect for fans of visual novels and detective games brimming with rich, dramatic narratives that grip players and stick with them long after the game\u2019s mysteries are solved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are <i>you</i> ready for a story you\u2019ll never forget?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unmasked Truths: Shattered Dreams is proudly created by humans, not AI.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/9ac4162d0bd141ab6483bbf38f9a2860.avif?t=1774038749\" width=500 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s the year 20XX and 10 world-renowned experts have agreed to take a rocket ride into space where they will take part in a first-of-its-kind intensive summer program run by the world\u2019s top governing authority.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their goal? Prove that they are the best of the best and worthy of the exclusive title:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World\u2606Class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a relaxing stay managed by AI twins at a lavish baroque space resort-turned-college-campus takes a deadly turn when it\u2019s revealed that only 5 individuals will be graduating with their title\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...and their lives.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players rotate between characters throughout the story, including a no-nonsense prosecutor, happy-go-lucky daredevil, strong-of-heart street fighter, K-Pop idol, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the 3D environment to collect evidence, participate in themed trials and minigames, and cast your vote to discover the truth of who's living a lie in this fully voiced murder mystery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/406f5ff9ba84a53ad31dfe60eedb05b3.webp?t=1774038749\" width=500 height=35 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/aac6092a7a1be025e162a0c87f9ee7f7.poster.avif?t=1774038749\" aria-label=\"Characters are fully voiced in English\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/aac6092a7a1be025e162a0c87f9ee7f7.webm?t=1774038749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/aac6092a7a1be025e162a0c87f9ee7f7.mp4?t=1774038749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Character dialogue is fully voiced in </u></strong><u>English <strong>and</strong> Japanese<strong>, featuring the talents of:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sophia Alexandra, World\u2606Class Teacher\u00a0-\u00a0<strong>Cherami Leigh</strong>\u00a0(English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maria Dandois, World\u2606Class Street Fighter -\u00a0<strong>Heather Gonzalez</strong>\u00a0(English),\u00a0<strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kristine Brown,\u00a0World\u2606Class Voyager -\u00a0<strong>Suzie McGrath</strong>\u00a0(English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ashe Buckley,\u00a0World\u2606Class Hunter -\u00a0<strong>Casey Mongillo</strong>\u00a0(English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lee Dae Hyun,\u00a0World\u2606Class Idol \u2014\u00a0<strong>Jason Vu</strong>, (English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucienne Gant,\u00a0World\u2606Class Barista - <strong>Ryan Bartley</strong>\u00a0(English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sergei Ivankov,\u00a0World\u2606Class Manager -\u00a0<strong>Kyle McCarley</strong>\u00a0(English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jack Pakenham,\u00a0World\u2606Class Daredevil - <strong>Leigh Joel Scott</strong>\u00a0(English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Izumi Sada, World\u2606Class Psychologist - <strong>Jenny Yokobori</strong>\u00a0(English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leandre Tha\u00efs, &quot;Some Guy&quot; - <strong>Nazeeh Tarsha</strong>\u00a0(English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renard Tha\u00efs,\u00a0World\u2606Class Prosecutor - <strong>Alejandro Saab</strong>\u00a0(English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alice - <strong>Xanthe Hyunh</strong>\u00a0(English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thomas -\u00a0<strong>Nathan Vitale</strong>\u00a0(English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Papa &quot;Joe&quot; Razzi -\u00a0<strong>Joe Zieja</strong>\u00a0(English), <strong>TBA</strong> (Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/4fb004aa4c7a2a5f7be72bef59b40f4d.poster.avif?t=1774038749\" aria-label=\"Choices change relationships and the game&#039;s ending\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/4fb004aa4c7a2a5f7be72bef59b40f4d.webm?t=1774038749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/4fb004aa4c7a2a5f7be72bef59b40f4d.mp4?t=1774038749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Decisions Matter</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player choices impact character relationships, unlock routes, unveil bonus scenes, and ultimately determine who survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/16e7bb24e34d652a49fd0cbdb3105c60.avif?t=1774038749\" alt=\"Play as different characters to learn the full story.\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras_big/16e7bb24e34d652a49fd0cbdb3105c60.webp?t=1774038749 width=1560 height=1101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Everyone is a Suspect</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone has been killed, and everyone is a potential suspect. Investigate the  scene for clues and gather evidence before engaging in a high-stakes debate to unveil the truth and unmask the murderer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/20d8ed9283370d59c9b1e18513cd07a5.avif?t=1774038749\" alt=\"Mirror your partner&#039;s moves in rhythm minigames!\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras_big/20d8ed9283370d59c9b1e18513cd07a5.webp?t=1774038749 width=1560 height=879 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/6d3c20b3bc629f7d012d020a6950680d.avif?t=1774038749\" alt=\"Fish for answers in this classic fishing minigame with a twist!\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras_big/6d3c20b3bc629f7d012d020a6950680d.webp?t=1774038749 width=1560 height=879 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Minigames</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress the story by clearing minigames inspired by the characters' unique skills! Fish for answers, engage in heated battles to see whose evidence is stronger, mirror your partner's moves to support their arguments, remove mental blocks to uncover clues, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/2f642a3edbc8f874f778a8b7ab582250.poster.avif?t=1774038749\" aria-label=\"Explore a vast 3D environment\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/2f642a3edbc8f874f778a8b7ab582250.webm?t=1774038749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/extras/2f642a3edbc8f874f778a8b7ab582250.mp4?t=1774038749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Free Roaming / Free Time Exploration</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam the vast college campus to discover more about the world, collect hidden items, witness spectacular views, and learn more about characters. The information may come in handy when unraveling the secrets of this social deduction game...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["SuperPROTEIN Studios Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512720/af37f4a94364f4a539fe46d3cd5ad573445ee087/header.jpg?t=1774038749","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3512720/571034902/ecc3f2ad2bbc187db6b59e2453611fe61fc29342/1765219248/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773857486","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3512720/571034902/ecc3f2ad2bbc187db6b59e2453611fe6